OL,3,GNEWSATawny owl boxes installed to
OL,4,Atackle allotment rodents
OL,5,
OL,6,FBird boxes have been installed at an
OL,7,Fallotment to encourage birds of prey to
OL,8,Fnest in them and in turn tackle a
OL,9,Frodent problem.
OL,11,FWallingford Town Council has introduced
OL,12,Fthe bird boxes at the Fir Tree
OL,13,FAllotments, in Oxfordshire, in the hope
OL,14,Fof attracting tawny owls to prey on its
OL,15,Fresident rat population.
OL,17,FThe allotments are used by the mental
OL,18,Fhealth charity Mind, which had reported
OL,19,Fthat rodents were consistently
OL,20,Ftargeting their fruit and vegetables.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
