OL,3,GNEWSATawny owl boxes installed to
OL,4,Atackle allotment rodents
OL,5,
OL,6,FTown councillor Mike Acreman explained
OL,7,Fthat gardeners had been "growing
OL,8,Ffantastic food... but the rats were
OL,9,Fcoming in and eating a lot of it".
